# --- Project rules -----------------------------------------------------------
# The shared software ships without facility data (see AGENTS.md/SHIPPING.md).
# User case artifacts are legitimate local work; these defaults avoid committing
# common data/model payloads accidentally. The user determines project policies.
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.npz
*.npy
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
# TRACK field tables are often numbered files, such as table.#12.
*.#*
# Run records, ledgers and job state written by the tools into a project folder.
.element_surrogate/
# Pinned AI-ModCon checkers fetched by `make ext`.
_ext/

# --- From AI-ModCon BaseTemplate ---------------------------------------------
# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

